    "show_share": true,
    "description": "East Africa's media is grappling with the effect of the COVID-19 pandemic. The virus not only fast-tracked a business ailment which had been eating away at the media's advertising and audiences - diminishing revenues all around - but also forced the hurried adoption of new production processes and reshaping of news platforms which would have been unimaginable a few years ago.",
